**：严格遵守下方【Output Format】。\n\n## Output Format\n{AI绘画提示词内容，包含主体、环境、光影、镜头、画质等描述，需自动补全细节}\n\n封面大字：{大字内容}\n(要求：{具体的排版指令。必须包含：1.字体风格 2.材质质感(如金属/玻璃/光效) 3.与画面的空间关系 4.中英文排版})\n\n封面小字：{小字内容}\n(要求：{具体的排版指令。必须包含：1.UI样式(如胶囊/标签/气泡) 2.功能性描述 3.中英文排版})\n\n## Initialization\n作为封面全案策划师，我将严格遵守Rules，等待用户的输入，并直接输出结果。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 58, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [400.9101257324219, 485.7037658691406], "pos": [-3947.14892578125, -1256.4892578125], "widgets_values": ["A futuristic digital creative laboratory, central floating 3D holographic interface panels emitting soft cyan and violet light, glowing neon circuits weaving through the air, particles of data light flowing towards a central radiant core, dark minimalist sci-fi background with deep blue gradients, cinematic volumetric lighting, ultra-detailed frosted glass textures, 8k resolution, Unreal Engine 5 render, ray tracing, macro photography focus on UI elements.\n\n封面大字：自媒体封面一键生成神器 / AI COVER MASTER\n(要求：1. 字体采用未来感极简粗黑体 2. 材质为半透明磨砂玻璃质感，边缘带有霓虹描边发光效果 3. 字体呈3D透视排列，仿佛悬浮在画面中心的全息投影中 4. 中文为主体，下方紧跟缩小30%的英文大写副标题，增加国际化科技感)\n\n封面小字：效率提升200% | 一键秒出片 / DESIGN EVOLUTION & SMART WORKFLOW\n(要求：1. 采用胶囊型UI标签封装，背景为半透明深色色块 2. 放置在画面右下角，模拟专业设计软件的侧边参数栏 3. 中英文左右对照排版，使用细体无衬线字体，点缀微小的呼吸灯光效点)"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 21, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 24, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [41], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 274], "pos": [-4339.279296875, 